# Frames that are variants a general alternation will cover (block "21:05" item 2; the library applies the
# alternations to every canonical frame once): `frame`, `alternation` (a w.lang.en.alternation_family: request
# wrapper, passive, dative shift, verb ellipsis), `canonical` (many) the frames of the same act and mode with none of
# these that take every role the variant takes. Marked, never deleted here: the frames are retired when the library's
# curve says so. Written by tools/lang-en-variants.mjs (shard variants), by rule from the frames' parts.
@w.lang.en.variant core.type of=w.lang.en.variant shared=true closed=true core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.variant.frame core.slot of=w.lang.en.variant key=frame id=true required=true kind=atom core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.variant.alternation core.slot of=w.lang.en.variant key=alternation id=true required=true kind=atom kind=string core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.variant.canonical core.slot of=w.lang.en.variant key=canonical many=true kind=atom core.source="hand-core 1"

# Words a request skips (block "21:05" item 5, asked by the first host): around the content of a request they carry
# no role. `class`: politeness (please), desire (want, like: a wish before the thing asked for), filler (also, just,
# um), conjunction (and, where it joins two things of one role), copula (be), reflexive (yourself, myself: the
# addressee or the speaker as the thing changed), request_preposition (of, on, to, for, with: skipped only by a reader
# that fills the parts of a thing and has no role marked by them). `text` (many) the words; `doc`.
@w.lang.en.skip core.type of=w.lang.en.skip shared=true closed=true core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.skip.class core.slot of=w.lang.en.skip key=class id=true required=true enum=politeness enum=desire enum=filler enum=conjunction enum=copula enum=reflexive enum=request_preposition core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.skip.text core.slot of=w.lang.en.skip key=text many=true required=true kind=atom kind=string core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.skip.doc core.slot of=w.lang.en.skip key=doc kind=string core.source="hand-core 1"

